      "id": "claim_ebab39193e27496d842da0b411cbae1f",
      "statement": "The secret per-client Access Key is looked up at runtime from the properties map using the key 'access_key.' + clientId; app.properties defines access_key entries for clients such as TSP, WSP, MSP, and MSP_EXTEND, with values templated for deployment config.",
